graph TD
    subgraph Order to Cash
        A[Sales Order] -->|WF-AR-001| B[Invoice Created]
        B -->|WF-AR-002| C[Payment Received]
        C --> D[Cash Applied]
    end

    subgraph Procure to Pay
        E[Stock Low]| WF-INV-001| F[PO Created]
        F -->|WF-PROC-001| G[PO Approved]
        G --> H[Goods Received]
        H -->|WF-AP-001| I[Bill Processed]
        I --> J[Payment Sent]
    end

    subgraph HR Processes
        K[Leave Request]| WF-HR-001| L[Manager Approval]
        L --> M[Leave Recorded]
    end

    subgraph Financial Core
        N[All Transactions]| WF-FIN-001| O[Journal Posted]
        O --> P[Ledger Updated]
    end

    B --> N
    C --> N
    I --> N
    D --> N
    J --> N

    style A fill:#4a9
    style E fill:#4a9
    style K fill:#4a9
    style N fill:#4a9
